==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 7.33~10 seconds<sup>220f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 14~17.33 seconds<sup>420f~520f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This stage is nearly identical to that of the Empire of Cats Chapter 1 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]], suggesting that a similar strategy should be used. While the enemies might seem stronger due to their boosts, [[Treasure]]s from the following chapters and higher levels keep this stage from being really difficult.

